{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"82c01025ba6ad7841686a045754adb0763bb61e620407485e300a35be888c873","ja":"誰そ彼時","zh":"黄昏时分","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c7e8844c65c9ac3a02bf7ceefd047b967fbddb30ee3be7252517a1f3a61f7c1d","ja":"でもでも、後ろ姿は、\n間違いなく響さんだった気が……？","zh":"可是可是，总觉得那个背影，\n绝对就是响小姐……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"51f4cfecb26d893987f4ab32f6d4ad80112d18518c5167540e9b565b356cfc01","ja":"自分、昨日の夕方は家族たちと出かけてて、\nこの近くには来てないんだ。","zh":"我昨天傍晚是和家里人出门了，\n没来这附近。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"60459bf2584c4a896a7f4e790db5806a3134fa7c39cc6ee08a3cbf7c6a206337","ja":"じゃあ本当に人違いだったのかな？\n私も絶対、響さんだと思ったんだけどなぁ。","zh":"看来真的只是认错人了吗？\n我也本来觉得绝对是响小姐的啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b92550a76d76c3d078c57567fb6db2e05ec4582934c38b3a5fce18db7a966f1b","ja":"黄昏時にそんな見間違いをするなんて、\n面白いお話ですね～。知ってますか～……。","zh":"在黄昏时分竟然会看错成那样，\n真是有趣的故事呢～。您知道吗～……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8ded4b3a17b57703cdb9b8b74a98ca6f9490c2e8e61facdb2b726e2bd8d383c0","ja":"黄昏の語源は、夕暮で人の顔が区別しづらくなって\n『誰そ彼』と尋ねることに由来するのだとか～。","zh":"“黄昏”一词的词源，据说是因为傍晚时分难以看清人的容貌，\n便询问“那人是谁（谁是彼）”而由来的呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"939fbbaf006f8fc0d7d64451fbd34125dcfdc8939877195facb90ab1fdbe2eed","ja":"あっ、私も聞いたことある！\n他にも何か不思議な話があったよね、えーっと……。","zh":"啊，我也听说过！\n好像还有其他什么不可思议的传闻对吧，让我想想……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"51faf9f6f39faf9e66b57f1812f08781992c2b1fe1ddb973b1beec3b04b6c30e","ja":"「黄昏時は不思議な時間。人ならざる者も、\nやってくる」……というものでしょうか～？","zh":"「逢魔时刻是不可思议的时间。非人之物\n也会前来」……大概是这种感觉吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"df7a632afdad245788593112a8b19a64c74aa6111b1bc6f5e734bc4fa2bedfe3","ja":"そう、それ！　それじゃあ響さんに似た人って……\nもしかして、ドッペルゲンガー！？","zh":"对，就是那个！那和响很像的人……\n难道是分身灵！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"d07cc874d8d474fb2355a33854f8699cc7c6aa4a3bdf50093ba2d09c716f4786","ja":"そ、そ、それって！　響さんがその人に\n会っちゃったら、不幸が訪れるってことですか！？","zh":"那、那、那就是说！如果响小姐和那个人\n相遇的话，就会招致不幸吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"da3fa6c07c10ded9c0b47a9df50726928497686e4fc0042d4eb38cadd72ee455","ja":"うぎゃ～！？　ど、どういうこと！？\n自分、もう劇場に来れないの！？","zh":"呜哇～！？　这、这是怎么回事！？\n我已经不能来剧场了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"708638ca0c0f4d18dc2ddf2bb0eb235596392ed0dd0e07f6d128c535d88dbfc2","ja":"お、落ち着いて響さん！\nとにかく後で、様子を見に行ってみるから！","zh":"冷、冷静一点，响！\n总之等会儿我会去看看情况的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"b4b75fb6cd840a8afde6c5a4e95633336e03c24db037b6c569e3de9b2d87de3c","ja":"私もついて行きましょう～。\n正体も気になりますし～。","zh":"我也一起跟去吧～。\n毕竟也很想知道真面目呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"ad1c714d20b8fd0b63dcbb9c429c68a0a3b16563f7bc49a0d9bf4abe83ec2fce","ja":"わ、私も！　怖いけど……響さんのためですから！\n頑張ってきますねっ！","zh":"我、我也要去！虽然有点害怕……但为了响小姐！\n我会加油的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1141.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"61668d17abcb83b553fb881d48a04467437294e3f3a101417461c4f60de42dc4","ja":"みんな……。う、うん……ありがとう！","zh":"大家……嗯、嗯……谢谢你们！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
